"PATH`` first. ``plugin_timeout`` defaults to 60 seconds per complete "
"process request; valid values are 1 through 86400. ``[plugin_configs]`` "
"maps IDs to configuration paths, relative to the project configuration "
"directory. A normal build invokes no publisher. ``--untrusted`` disables "
"native build plugins. In Guidedog 0.6.2, build plugins provide source "
"transformations, HTML post-processing, and generated assets. See "
":doc:`../plugins` for the complete tutorial and architecture."
